A span's closer after a blank keeps the list tight

```
- %%%

  %%%
- d
.
<ul>
  <li></li>
  <li>d</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  %%%

  %%%
- d
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
  <li>d</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  - b
    %%%

    %%%
- c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>c</li>
</ul>
```

